Page 34 il-: Found match for regex: =
Page 34 il-: -------- begin text --------

===Prefix===
{{head|ca|prefix}}

# {{ca-form of|Form used before a root beginning with the letter ''l''|in-}}

====Usage notes====
Normally this prefix will combine with the root to make a word that uses the {{m|ca|ela geminada}}. For example, {{m|ca|il-}} and {{m|ca|legal}} combine to form {{m|ca|il·legal}}. but for some words, the use of the {{m|ca|ela palatal}} will provide an alternate form or the preferred form. Thus {{m|ca||il-}} and {{m|ca|legible}} can combine to form either {{m|ca|illegible}} or {{m|ca|il·legible}}, while {{m|ca||il-}} and {{m|ca|letrat||literate}} combine only as {{m|ca|illetrat||illiterate}} in Standard Catalan, although {{m|ca|il·letrat}} is a common, but still illiterate, misspelling.

====Derived terms====
{{prefixsee|ca}}

-------- end text --------
