Page 881 ela geminada: Found match for regex: =
Page 881 ela geminada: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ca|ele geminada||Valencia}}

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|f|eles geminades}}

# the [[Appendix:Latin script|Latin]] script combination ⟨[[l·l]]⟩ (uppercase ⟨[[L·L]]⟩)
#: {{cot|ca|ela doble|ela palatal}}

====Usage notes====
* The {{m|ca|ela palatal}} is used in Catalan to represent the palatal lateral {{IPAchar|/ʎ/}} with a digraph [[ll]], so to indicate where a doubled alveolar lateral is intended {{IPAchar|/l.l/}}, a {{m|ca|punt volat||interpunct|tr=&nbsp;·&nbsp;}} is placed between the two ells to form an {{m|ca||ela geminada|lit=[[geminated]] [[ell]]}}.
* It never occurs at the beginning of a word. The form *“L·l” does not exist.

{{C|ca|Orthography}}
