===Etymology===
{{bor+|ca|frk|*meisinga}}. The Catalan form first became {{m|ca|*merlenga}} under the influence of {{m|ca|merla||blackbird}} and then {{m|ca|merellenga}} by [[folk etymology]], influenced by {{m|ca|llengua||tongue}}, as tits are considered noisy birds. Finally, [[metathesis]] in some varieties yielded the form ''mallerenga''. Compare {{cog|oc|mesenga}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA|ê}}

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|f}}

# any native bird of the family [[Paridae]], such as the [[long-tailed tit]] (''[[Aegithalos caudatus]]'') or the [[blue tit]] (''[[Cyanistes caeruleus]]'')
