# [[pair]] {{gloss|male and female of the same species}}
# [[significant other]]
#: {{uxi|ca|En Miquel és la '''parella''' de na Maria.}}
# {{lb|ca|cards}} [[pair]] {{gloss|set of two cards with equal rank, but not necessarily the same suit}}
#: {{uxi|ca|Una '''parella''' d'asos.}}
