===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA|ê}}
* {{rhymes|ca|ɛza|s=2}}

===Etymology 1===
{{unc|ca}}. Either from {{bor|ca|fr|fraise}} or from {{der|ca|VL.|*frēsare}}<ref>{{R:DCVB}}</ref>, from {{m|la|frēsum}}, perfect passive participle of {{der|ca|la|frendēre||to grind}}. It was attested only in the 19th century however, and probably a borrowing from French or Latin<ref>{{R:GDLC}}</ref>. See also {{cog|es|fresa}}.

====Noun====
{{ca-noun|f}}

# [[milling cutter]]

=====Related terms=====
