From {{m|ca|persà}}, from {{der|ca|la|Persa}}, {{m|la|Persēs}}, from {{der|ca|grc|Περσίς}}, from {{der|ca|peo|𐎱𐎠𐎼𐎿||Persia|ts=Pārsa}}.

