Page 6166 oreneta: Found match for regex: =
Page 6166 oreneta: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ca|oroneta}}

===Etymology===
Probably from metathesis of an {{inh|ca|roa-oca||*eroneta}}, from a {{inh|ca|VL.||*hirundĭtta}}, a diminutive of {{der|ca|la|hirundō}}.<ref>{{R:GDLC}}</ref> The suffix may have also been an internal formation within early Catalan: compare the different suffixes used in nearby Romance cognates: {{cog|oc|ironda}}, {{m|oc|randoleta}}, {{m|oc|irondela}}, {{cog|es|golondrina}}, {{cog|pt|andorinha}}, {{cog|fr|hirondelle}}, {{cog|it|rondine}}, cf. also {{cog|ro|rândunea}}, {{m|ro|rândunică}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{audio|ca|LL-Q7026 (cat)-Unjoanqualsevol-oreneta.wav|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|f}}

# [[swallow]] {{gloss|bird}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ca|cua d'oreneta}}
* {{l|ca|herba d'orenetes}}
* {{l|ca|niu d'oreneta}}
* {{l|ca|oreneta cuablanca}}

===References===
<references/>

===Further reading===
* {{R:IEC2}}
* {{R:DNV}}
* {{R:DCVB}}

{{C|ca|Swallows}}
