===Etymology===
From a substantivation of the feminine of {{inh|ca|roa-oca|empent}} (the original past participle of {{m|ca|empènyer}}), from {{inh|ca|VL.|*impinctus}}, as an alternative past participle of {{inh|ca|la|impingō}} (instead of the Classical participle {{m|la|impāctus}}). The Vulgar Latin form would have ordinarily yielded a Catalan {{m|roa-oca||*empint}}, but analogy with other forms of the verb resulted in {{m|roa-oca|empent}}. Compare {{cog|it|impinta}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA|ê}}

===Noun===
