#* {{quote-song|ca|year=2019|artist=El Petit de Cal Eril|title=Sento|album=Energia fosca|text=Coses inútils com les '''caixes''' o els bancs / Coses terribles com les bales o els tancs}}
# {{lb|ca|woodworking}} [[mortise]]

====Usage notes====
There is a semantical difference in the usage of {{m|ca|caixa}} and {{m|ca|capsa}} according to their size. Boxes larger than a shoebox are usually called {{m|ca|caixa}}, while boxes smaller than a shoebox (e.g. for matches, confectioneries, pills) are {{m|ca|capsa}}.

