===Etymology===
At least two {{unk|ca|theories}} are suggested:
* From {{bor|ca|eu||mart-|blackberry; bramble}}, as in {{m|eu|martotx||bramble}}, {{m|eu|martsuts}}, {{m|eu|martuza||blackberry}}. Basque also gave {{cog|an|martuel}}, {{cog|es|madroño}}. Similar sense development in {{noncog|gl|amorodo}}, {{noncog|pt|morango||strawberry}}, both from {{m|pt|amora||blackberry; bramble}}.
* From {{der|ca|cel-gau|*majoþa}}. Compare {{cog|oc|majofa}}, {{cog|lmo|magiostra}}.

Note also {{cog|hy|մաթուզ}}.

