{{unc|ca}}. Possibly from {{der|ca|xib|-}}/{{der|ca|xce|*bruxtia}} (compare {{cog|oc|bruèissa}}, {{cog|pt|bruxa}}, {{cog|es|bruja}}), from {{der|ca|cel-pro|*brixtā|t=spell, magic}} (compare {{cog|sga|bricht|t=charm}}, {{cog|obt|brith|t=magic}}). It could instead be akin to a different {{der|ca|cel|-}} word such as {{m+|sga|Brigit|lit=high, exalted}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{audio|ca|LL-Q7026 (cat)-Unjoanqualsevol-bruixa.wav|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|f}}

# [[witch]]
# [[megrim]]

