Along with {{cog|oc|rauja||rage}} from {{inh|ca|LL|rabia}}, classical {{m|la|rabiēs||rage}}. The appearance of ''x'' in place of ''j'' likely due to {{m|ca|raixa||a violent emotion}}. {{doublet|ca|ràbia}}.

