Page 7157 campanya: Found match for regex: =
Page 7157 campanya: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Ultimately from {{der|ca|LL.|campānia}}, from {{m|la|campāneus}}, from {{der|ca|la|campus}}; however the date of first attestation was relatively late, in 1523<ref>{{R:GDLC}}</ref> (it may have been influenced by similar words in other languages; unlike them, however, the Catalan word does not have the sense of "open countryside"). Compare {{cog|oc|campanha}}, {{cog|fr|champagne}}, {{cog|es|campaña}}, {{cog|pt|campanha}}, {{cog|it|campagna}} (possibly the source of the Catalan word). {{doublet|ca|xampany}}, taken from French.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|ca|aɲa|s=3}}

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|f}}

