====Usage notes====
The relationship between {{m|en|Great Britain}} and {{m|en|Brittany||Little Britain}} is clearer in Catalan than in English, at the cost of lacking a one word synonym for Great Britain. To refer to Roman Britain in Catalan, a later reborrowing from the same Latin origin, {{m|ca|Britània}}, is used.

