===Etymology===
First recorded in {{inh|ca|la|[[castrum|Castrum]] [[Caucoliberi]]}}.<br/>Possibly from an {{der|ca|xib|-}} root {{m|xib|*kauk-||bay}} and {{der|ca|la|Illiberi}}, the ancient name of the town of {{w|Elne}} (in Catalan {{m|ca|Elna}}); interpretable as “port of Illiberi”.<br/>
Compare {{m|ca|lliure||free}}.

