# {{lb|ca|intransitive}} to [[live]] poorly
#* {{quote-journal|ca|journal=La Vanguardia|author=Ima Sanchís|date=June 21 2019|title="Vivim en una societat fracturada que anhela la trobada"
|passage=Vaig ser pobríssima durant molts anys. El meu pare no tenia feina, '''malvivíem''' a casa dels avis.
|t=I was extremely poor for many years. My father didn't have a job; '''we lived poorly''' in my grandparents' house.
