====Usage notes====
* The {{m|ca||ela palatal}} is used in Catalan to represent the palatal lateral {{IPAchar|/ʎ/}} with a digraph [[ll]], so to indicate where a doubled alveolar lateral is intended {{IPAchar|/l.l/}}, a {{m|ca|punt volat||interpunct|tr=&nbsp;·&nbsp;}} is placed between the two ells to form an {{m|ca|ela geminada}}.

