#* {{quote-web
|ca
|work=CCMA Notícies
|title=Segona nit d'aldarulls per les restriccions anti-Covid a Madrid, Màlaga i Logronyo
|date=2020-11-01
|url=https://www.ccma.cat/324/segons-nit-daldarulls-per-les-restriccions-anti-covid-a-madrid-malaga-i-logronyo/noticia/3056848/
|passage=El malestar per les restriccions per la Covid, sumat al negacionisme i, en alguns casos, a convocatòries d'extrema dreta, s'estén. Divendres van ser Barcelona, Burgos i Santander, i aquest dissabte hi ha hagut protestes amb '''aldarulls''' a Madrid, Màlaga, Logronyo, Bilbao i, de nou, Santander.
|t=Discontent with the restrictions due to COVID is spreading, combined with denialism and, in certain cases, with far-right organizing. On Friday it was Barcelona, Burgos, and Santander, and this Saturday there were protests with '''riots''' in Madrid, Málaga, Logroño, Bilbao, and again in Santander.}}

