* {{hyph|ca|es|qui|ròl}}

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ca|VL.|scūriolus}}, a diminutive of {{m|la|scūrius}}, metathesized variant of {{inh|ca|la|sciūrus}}, ultimately from {{der|ca|grc|σκίουρος}}. Compare {{cog|oc|esquirou}}, {{cog|an|escrihuelo}} and {{m|an|esquiruelo}}, and {{cog|it|scoiattolo}}.

====Noun====
{{ca-noun|m}}

# [[squirrel]]
# [[red squirrel]]

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ca|esquirol llistat}}
* {{l|ca|esquirol volador}}

===Etymology 2===
{{wikipedia|esquirol (economia)|esquirol (strikebreaker)|lang=ca}}
From {{w|L'Esquirol}}, a Catalan locality from where the workers came who, at the end of the 19th century, occupied the work place of the workers of {{w|Manlleu}} during a [[strike]].

====Noun====
{{ca-noun|m}}

# {{lb|ca|pejorative}} [[strikebreaker]], [[scab]], [[blackleg]], [[scalie]] {{gloss|non-unionized worker hired to replace striking workers}}
# {{lb|ca|pejorative}} [[strikebreaker]], [[scab]], [[blackleg]], [[scalie]] {{gloss|a worker who acts against trade union policies, especially a strikebreaker}}

