From {{af|ca|que|maco|t1=how|t2=nice}}, a phrase often exclaimed by visitors to rural areas.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|imitating the Barcelonan pronunciation}} {{IPA|ca|[kɐˈma.ku]}}
* {{a|Central}} {{IPA|ca|/kəˈma.ku/}}
* {{a|North-western}} {{IPA|ca|/kaˈma.ku/|/kaˈma.ko/}}

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|m}}

# {{lb|ca|Catalonia}} Someone who comes from a large [[city]] to the [[countryside]]
#* {{quote-book|ca|year=2001|author=Enric Sànchez-Cid|title=Ermites i temples insòlits de Catalunya|publisher=Cossetània Edicions|isbn=9788495684349|page=106
|passage=És un indret de gran atracció turística, sobretot per als '''"quemacos"''' que volen  comprovar quin gust té l'aigua que arriba a les seves aixetes abans de passar pel clor.
|t=It's a place with great touristic attraction, especially for the "'''''quemacos'''''" who want to test the taste of the water that comes out of their faucets before it passes through chlorine.}}
#: {{syn|ca|pixapí|pixapins}}
