From {{m|ca|vitx}}, dialectal plural form of {{m|ca|vit||penis}}. The plural form was taken for a singular and gave rise to a new plural form, '''vitxos'''. The singular form '''bitxo''' was created from this via [[back-formation]] and respelled in accordance with the Catalonian merger of /v/ and /b/.

