===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ca|VL.|capus||head, chief}}, from {{inh|ca|la|caput||head, etc.}}, from {{inh|ca|itc-pro|*kaput}}, ultimately from {{der|ca|ine-pro|*kauput-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*káput}}. Compare {{cog|oc|cap}}. Compare also {{m+|fr|personne}} (which can mean either "person" or "nobody").

====Noun====
{{ca-noun|m}}

# {{lb|ca|anatomy}} [[head]]
# [[boss]], [[chief]], [[leader]]
#: {{uxi|ca|'''cap''' d'estat|'''head''' of state}}
# [[cape]] {{gloss|piece of land}}
# {{lb|ca|heraldry}} [[chief]]
# [[end]]
#: {{uxi|ca|'''cap''' de setmana|week'''end'''}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|ca|al cap de|al cap i a la fi|cabut|caparra|capbaix|capdavant|capdret|cap d'any|cap d'ase|cap d'estat|cap de setmana|Cap Verd|capejar|capgirar|capgròs|captenir-se|cappare|capvespre|pel cap alt|pel cap baix}}

====Determiner====
{{ca-det|inv}}

# [[no]], not [[any]] {{lb|ca|usually with ''no'' or other negative particle}}
#: {{ux|ca|No hi ha '''cap''' iogurt de maduixa.|There is '''no''' strawberry yogurt.}}
#* {{quote-journal|ca|journal=El Punt Avui|title=La demanda de tractament per deixar la cocaïna creix|author=Rosa M. Bravo|date=August 21 2019
|passage=A més, 3.500 persones han passat per les sales de consum ateses per professionals, on '''cap''' de les 214 sobredosis ha estat mortal.
|t=Additionally, 3,500 people have passed through the [drug] use rooms tended by professionals, where '''none''' of the 214 overdoses has been fatal.
|url=http://www.elpuntavui.cat/societat/article/14-salut/1653041-la-demanda-de-tractament-per-deixar-la-cocaina-creix.html}}
# [[any]] {{lb|ca|in questions and suppositions}}
#: {{ux|ca|Que hi falta '''cap''' peça?|Is there '''any''' missing piece?}}

====Pronoun====
{{head|ca|pronoun}}

# [[none]], not [[one]] {{gloss|usually with ''no'' or other negative particle}}
#: {{ux|ca|no n'hi ha '''cap''' de maduixa|there is not '''any''' strawberry flavoured one}}
# [[anyone]] {{gloss|in questions and suppositions}}
#: {{uxi|ca|que en falta '''cap'''?|is there '''anyone''' missing?}}

====Preposition====
{{head|ca|preposition}}

# [[towards]], [[to]]

