#: {{uxi|ca|'''trencar-se''' un braç|to '''break''' an arm}}
# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[crack]]
# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[crease]]
# {{lb|ca|transitive|figurative}} to [[break into]], to [[interrupt]]
#: {{syn|ca|interrompre}}
# {{lb|ca|intransitive}} to [[break off]] {{gloss|to change direction suddenly}}

====Conjugation====
{{ca-conj-ar|trenc}}

