|t='''Knocking down''' statues of pirates, slave traders, plutocrats and oppressors also teaches history to new generations, the same history that the now criticized statues taught, but, of course, with different views.
|url=https://www.elpuntavui.cat/opinio/article/8-articles/1816844-estatues.html}}
