===Etymology===
{{inh+|ca|roa-oca|trigar}}, from {{inh|ca|la|tricor|trīcārī|t=dally, shuffle, be evasive}}. Compare {{cog|oc|trigar}}, {{cog|fr|tricher||to cheat}}.

