Page 15723 és clar: Found match for regex: =
Page 15723 és clar: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ca|esclar}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA|esclàr}}

====Usage notes====
In most dialects the interjection has undergone {{glossary|univerbation}}, and it is pronounced as a single {{glossary|oxytonic}} word. This in turn triggers the reduction of {{IPAchar|/e/}} into {{IPAchar|/ə/}} in Eastern dialects. However, the form {{m|ca|esclar}} is still considered a misspelling.

===Interjection===
{{head|ca|interjection}}

# [[of course]]
