===Etymology===
{{inh+|ca|la|demandāre}}, infinitive of {{m|la|demandō}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|ca|a(ɾ)}}

===Verb===
{{ca-verb}}

# to [[ask]] for; to [[request]]
#* [E]l síndic de l'Alguer encara s'adreça al Ministre d'Afers Interiors '''demanant''' permís per acceptar el donatiu bibliogràfic
#*: The Algher syndicate addressed the Minister of Interior Affairs, '''requesting''' permission to accept the bibliographic donation
#: {{syn|ca|sol·licitar|q1=formal}}
# to [[ask]] {{gloss|put forth a question}}
#* {{quote-book|ca|year=2010|author=Blanca Busquets|title=Vés a saber on és el cel|publisher=ROSA VENTS|isbn=9788401387586
|passage=Què t'ha semblat, la carta d'en Ramon, m'ha '''demanat''' mentre esperàvem que ens servissin.
|t=What did you think of Ramon's letter, she '''asked''' me while we waited to be served.}}
#: {{syn|ca|preguntar}}
# {{lb|ca|reflexive|demanar-se}} to [[wonder]]
#* {{quote-book|ca|year=2014|author=Blanca Busquets|title=Paraules a mitges|publisher=ROSA VENTS|isbn=9788415961598
|passage=De seguida, li feia somrient, i mentre anava cap a la cuina, '''em demanava''' si ella i les altres em perdonarien mai el que estava a punt de fer.
|t=Immediately, I smiled at her, and as I went toward the kitchen, I '''wondered''' if she and the others would ever forgive me for what I was about to do.}}
#: {{syn|ca|preguntar|alt1=preguntar-se}}
# to [[need]], [[require]], [[demand]]
#* {{quote-book|ca|year=2014|author=Fra Valentí Serra de Manresa|title=Hortalisses i flors remeieres: Les herbes santes dels caputxins|publisher=Editorial Mediterrània, SL|isbn=9788499792972
|passage=Els carbassons '''demanen''' molt de sol i poc vent.
|t=Cucumbers '''require''' lots of sun and little wind.}}
#: {{syn|ca|exigir|necessitar|requerir}}

====Conjugation====
{{ca-conj-ar|deman}}

====Related terms====
{{rel3
