Page 16210 centenar: Found match for regex: =
Page 16210 centenar: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{af|ca|centè|-ar}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|m}}

# a set of [[one hundred]] like objects
#: {{ux|ca|Prop d'un '''centenar''' de persones es van congregar ahir a la plaça Sant Jaume.|Nearly a '''hundred''' people came together yesterday at the Plaça Sant Jaume.}}
# a quantity of approximately [[one hundred]]
# {{lb|ca|historical|military}} in the armies of Catalonia before the [[:w:Nueva Planta decrees|Nueva Planta decrees]], a company of one hundred men

====Usage notes====
* {{m|ca||Centenar}} is used to express quantities expressed to a precision of the nearest hundred, or a set of one hundred. For the number one hundred exactly, {{m|ca|cent}} is used.

===Further reading===
* {{R:IEC2}}

