Alteration of {{inh|ca|roa-oca|desparar}} (possibly by influence of {{der|ca|es|disparar}}), either from {{m|roa-oca|des-}} + {{m|roa-oca|parar}} or inherited from {{inh|ca|la|disparō|disparāre|t=separate}}, from {{m|la|dis-}} + {{m|la|parō||make equal}}, although it was taken as the negative of {{m|la|parō||prepare, arrange}} in Romance.

