* [[w:Western Catalan|Western]]: {{IPA|ca|/bɾeˈsa/}} (''[[w:Northwestern Catalan|Northwestern]]''), {{IPA|ca|/bɾeˈsaɾ/}} (''[[w:Valencian|Valencian]]'')
