# a quantity of roughly one thousand
#: {{syn|ca|milenar}}
#* {{quote-journal|ca|journal=Ara|title=10 coses que encara no sabem del cervell [10 things we still don't know about the brain]|date=Dec 12 2020|author=David Bueno
|passage=Encara més: els òrgans dels sentits estan formats per '''milers''' de cèl·lules receptores que envien cadascuna el seu propi missatge al cervell.
|t=On top of that, our sensory organs are made up of '''thousands''' of receptor cells that each send their own message to the brain.
|url=https://www.ara.cat/societat/10-coses-misteris-cervell-huma-neurociencia_0_2580941903.html}}

====Usage notes====
Rather than using the feminine ordinal ({{m|ca|milena}} or {{m|ca|mil·lèsima}}) as the word for a set of one thousand as is usual, for one thousand ''miler'' and ''milenar'' are used.

