Page 18186 ésser: Found match for regex: =
Page 18186 ésser: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ca|esser|ser}}

===Etymology===
{{dercat|ca|itc-pro|ine-pro}}
From early {{inh|ca|ML.|essere}}, from {{inh|ca|la|sum|esse}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{audio|ca|LL-Q7026 (cat)-Unjoanqualsevol-ésser.wav|Audio}}

===Verb===
{{ca-verb|pres_1_sg=soc|past_part=estat}}

# {{lb|ca|copulative}} to [[be]]
# to [[exist]], to be [[real]], to be [[reality]]

====Usage notes====
* '''Ésser''' in the sense of "to be" is used for a characteristic of a person or object. ''See also'': {{m|ca|estar}}.
*: {{uxi|ca|'''Soc''' britànic, '''és''' catalana.|I'm British, she's Catalan.}}
*: {{uxi|ca|L'or '''és''' groc.|Gold is yellow.}}
* '''Ésser''' + ''past participle'' forms the passive voice.
*: {{uxi|ca|'''Era''' pagat per la Generalitat.|I was paid by the Generalitat.}}

