Page 18292 sorneguer: Found match for regex: =
Page 18292 sorneguer: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Derived from {{m|ca|sorna}}, cognate with [[Spanish]] and [[Portuguese]] ''[[sorna]]'', the etymology of which is unknown. It seems to be a non-Catalan word in origin, given the lack of medieval documentation and the fact that it is not a usual word in the popular and archaic varieties; Yet the word sorneguer is so characteristic of Catalan, it seems to favor the catalanity of a hypothetical primitive ''sorna''.

