===Etymology===
From {{prefix|ca|con|parèixer}}, based on {{der|ca|la|compāreō|compārēre}}, or taken from a {{der|ca|VL.|-}} root {{m|la||*comparescere}}. First attested 1575, and replaced Old Catalan {{m|roa-oca|comparer}}. Compare {{cog|fr|comparaître}} and {{cog|it|comparire}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA|ê}}
* {{rhymes|ca|ɛʃe(ɾ)|s=4}}

===Verb===
{{ca-verb|pres_1_sg=comparec|past_part=comparegut}}

# to [[appear]], to [[attend]], to [[show up]]
# to be [[found]] {{gloss|after having been [[lost]]}}

