===Etymology===
Ultimately from {{der|ca|la|patior|patī}}. Attested in the writings of {{w|Ramon Llull}}.<ref>{{R:DCVB}}</ref> Coromines tentatively proposes that it was inherited (if so, via {{der|ca|VL.|*patīre}}), considering its relatively "popular" character.<ref>{{R:es:CP|padecer|334|vol=Me-Re}}</ref> This, however, would be at odds with the unlenited /-t-/.

