|t=It never seems like he's going to a concrete place to do '''anything''' concrete there. He strolls.
|url=https://www.lavanguardia.com/opinion/20190811/463991599122/el-meu-vei-el-music.html}}

=====Usage notes=====
In Algherese, this form alternates with {{m|ca|arrés}}: ''arrés'' is the default form; whereas ''res'' is used after prepositions or words ending in the sound {{IPAchar|[a]}}.

=====Alternative forms=====
* {{alt|ca|re}}
* {{alt|ca|rès||obsolete}}
* {{alt|ca|arrés||Algherese}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ca|de res}}
* {{l|ca|no-res}}

