Page 20259 tocar el dos: Found match for regex: =
Page 20259 tocar el dos: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{m|ca|tocar||touch}} {{m|ca|el||the}} and archaic Catalan {{m|ca|dos||back}}, to tap the back of a horse or other transport animals to encourage him moving forward.

===Verb===
{{head|ca|verb|head=[[tocar]] [[el]] [[dos]]}}

# {{lb|ca|idiom}} to [[leave]]; to [[up and leave]]; to [[scram]]

====Usage notes====
Because ''dos'' is an obsolete spelling of {{m|ca|dors||back}}, the literal meaning is sometimes interpreted as "touch the two" by those not aware of the history.
-------- end text --------
