Page 21542 aviat: Found match for regex: =
Page 21542 aviat: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|ca|at|s=3}}

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ca|roa-oca|viats}}, {{m|ca|vivats}}, {{m|ca|ivaç}}, from {{inh|ca|la|vīvācius}}, comparative form of {{m|la|vīvāciter||vigorously}}. Compare obsolete {{cog|it|avaccio|t=soon}}.

====Adverb====
{{ca-adv}}

# [[soon]]
#: {{syn|ca|tost|de seguida|ràpidament}}
#: {{uxi|ca|El sopar '''aviat''' estarà fet.|Dinner will be ready '''soon'''.}}
# [[early]]
