{{ca-adj|salada}}

# {{n-g|the use of articles with ''s'' in certain Catalan dialects, as opposed to the usual ones with ''l''; these articles descend from Latin {{m|la|ipse}} and its forms, rather than {{m|la|ille}}, from which the articles in other Catalan dialects and Romance languages descended}}
#: {{l|ca|el}} → {{l|ca|es}}, {{l|ca|so}}
#: {{l|ca|la}} → {{l|ca|sa}}
#: {{l|ca|l'}} → {{l|ca|s'}}
#: {{l|ca|els}} → {{l|ca|es}}, {{l|ca|sos}}
#: {{l|ca|les}} → {{l|ca|ses}}

