|passage=Així doncs, a través de la veu sincera dels nens, que de manera espontània i informal relaten algunes de les actituds de risc que adopten els seus progenitors quan circulen, se’ns alerta que comportaments quotidians que mostrem poden comportar situacions de perill a la carretera i que, sovint, no en som '''del tot''' conscients.
|t=So, through the honest voice of children, which spontaneously and informally tells some of the risky behaviors that their parents adopt when they drive, we are alerted to the daily behaviors that we show may entail dangerous situations on the road which, often, we're not '''entirely''' aware of.
