{{inh+|ca|roa-oca|sou}}~{{m|roa-oca|sol}}, from {{inh|ca|LL.|soldus}}, contraction of {{inh|ca|la|solĭdus}}. {{doublet|ca|sòlid}}. Compare {{cog|fr|sou}}.

====Noun====
{{ca-noun|m}}

# [[salary]], [[wage]]
#: {{syn|ca|salari}}
#: {{uxi|ca|tinc un '''sou''' de 1200 euros|I have a '''salary''' of 1200 euros}}

===Etymology 2===

====Verb====
{{head|ca|verb form}}

# {{ca-verb form of|p=2|n=pl|t=pres|m=ind|ser}}
# {{ca-verb form of|p=2|n=pl|m=impr|ser}}

===Etymology 3===
{{inh+|ca|roa-oca|sou}} (feminine {{m|roa-oca|sua}}), from {{inh|ca|la|suus|suum}}, from {{inh|ca|itc-pro|*sowos}}, from {{inh|ca|ine-pro|*sewos}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*swé||self}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|ca|seu||non-Algherese dialects}}

====Pronoun====
{{head|ca|pronoun|cat2=possessive pronouns|feminine|sua|masculine plural|sous|feminine plural|sues}}
# {{lb|ca|Algherese}} [[your]], [[yours]] (singular, alluding to {{m|ca|vostè}})
# {{lb|ca|Algherese}} [[his]], [[her]]/[[hers]], [[its]]
# {{lb|ca|Algherese|archaic|rare}} [[their]], [[theirs]]

=====Usage notes=====
In contemporary Algherese, this word primarily gives reference to ''vostè''. Only rarely does it give reference to multiple possessors, this use being archaic.

=====See also=====
* {{l|ca|son}}

====References====
* {{cite-web|title=sou (2)|url=http://www.algueres.net/vocabols/24887/sou_2.aspx|work=Diccionari d'Alguerés|accessdate=17 May 2022}}
* {{cite-book
|editor=|editors=
|title=El Català de l'Alguer : un model d'àmbit restringit
|location=Barcelona
|year=2003
|page=30
|isbn=84-7283-716-5
|text=}}

====Further reading====
* {{R:IEC2}}
* {{R:DCVB}}

