Page 26231 jovençà: Found match for regex: =
Page 26231 jovençà: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Probably from {{inh|ca|VL.|*iuvenciānus}}, from {{der|ca|la|iuvencus||young}}. A derivation from {{cog|cel-pro|*yowankos}} has also been proposed on account of the suffix.

