Page 27138 aquí: Found match for regex: =
Page 27138 aquí: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ca|VL.|*eccum hīc}}, from {{inh|ca|la|eccum}} + {{m|la|hīc}} ("this here"), the latter from {{m|la|hīc}}, ultimately from {{der|ca|ine-pro|*ǵʰi-ḱe||this, here}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{audio|ca|LL-Q7026 (cat)-Unjoanqualsevol-aquí.wav|Audio}}
* {{rhymes|ca|i|s=2}}

===Adverb===
{{ca-adv}}

# [[here]]
#: {{syn|ca|ací|q1=Valencia}}
#: {{cot|ca|allí|allà}}
# {{lb|ca|Valencia|classic system}} [[there]]

====Usage notes====
In the classic three-grade system, {{m|ca||aquí}} is second grade and thus means “there”; in systems that make no distinction between the first and second grades, {{m|ca||aquí}} supplants {{m|ca|ací}}, thus taking on the additional meaning of “here”.

In Valencian systems, {{m|ca|ahí}} rather than ''aquí'' is used for the second grade while ''aquí'' is used for the first grade alongside {{m|ca|ací}} in various northern and southern dialects.

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ca|d'aquí a}}
* {{l|ca|d'aquí poc}}

===See also===
{{ca-decl-dpron}}

===References===
* {{R:DCVB}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:IEC2}}
* {{R:GDLC}}
* {{R:DNV}}

-------- end text --------
